            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d) Council officers, representatives, or stewards will be permitted to draw on a bank of 2,000 hours for external or internal Council business. If negotiation meetings are called during the regular workday, the members of the MCCSSE negotiating team, numbering no more than thirteen (13) unit members, will have their leave charged to the leave bank to permit their participation. The leave shall be granted in terms of hours rather than days. Leave will be granted in accordance with the current procedures.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
